# DoormanOfDrain (18343, level 78) that hates humans by 20% (SetHateRace @race_human, ratio 20), every draw 0: the
# character casting an offensive skill (4694) beside it makes it want to attack the character by that ratio times 150.
character Hunter 20
skill 4694 1
roll player 0
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.WizardBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.Wizard.Wizard
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.Wizard.DoormanOfDrain
npc door 18343 Monster 150 0 0 level 78 skill DD_MAGIC 5043 10 ai SetHateRace=@race_human,SetHateRaceRatio=20
npc wolf 20120 Monster 150 100 0

cast wolf 4694
  S MagicSkillUse caster=player target=wolf skill=4694-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=46 4:4694,1
  desires door attack(player)=3000
